  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_004 (multimodal, multiprofile) achieves 54.2% validation accuracy. This experiment tests a similar multimodal setup with multiprofile but uses pca_n2000 RNA encoder and resnet50 image encoder instead of scgpt and imagenet_vit_l. This clarifies the impact of simpler encoders on performance while keeping costs low (estimated ~2.5 GPU hours). It balances exploration of encoder choices with exploitation of the promising multimodal/multiprofile direction."
